v {xschem version=3.4.7 file_version=1.2

* uvlo -- drive-rail undervoltage-lockout comparator/reference sub-cell
* (issue #220, spec/gate-driver.md Sec.5; parameters ratified by
* spec/decision-records/0001-block-interface-and-uvlo-parameters.md
* Decisions 4-5). Actual measured PVT numbers against those targets are
* recorded in spec/decision-records/0018-uvlo-comparator-pvt-measurement.md
* and sim/uvlo-trip-verification/records/ -- read that record before
* assuming the typ numbers below hold at every corner; they do not.
*
* Topology, exactly as decision record 0001 Decision 5 specifies: a
* resistive divider off VDD_DRV (R1/R2) compared against a diode-connected
* 6V0-corner NMOS Vt reference (XMREF), both built from nfet_06v0/pfet_06v0
* only -- no bandgap, no thin-oxide device (spec Sec.2.5, drive-rail
* domain; this cell has no VDD_LOGIC/GND_LOGIC pins at all, consistent with
* decision record 0001 Decision 5's "only VDD_DRV is monitored").
*
* Ports:
*   VDD_DRV -- 5V nominal / 6V stretch drive rail (block VDD_DRV)
*   GND_DRV -- drive rail return (block GND_DRV)
*   OUT     -- block OUT net (shared with output_stage's OUT, decision
*              record 0001 Decision 5) -- this cell actively pulls OUT low
*              (XMPD, a large nfet_06v0) whenever VDD_DRV is below the
*              rising threshold / above the falling threshold has not yet
*              been crossed, i.e. during lockout, overriding IN
*              unconditionally (XMPD's gate is driven only by this cell's
*              own comparator chain, never by IN or IN_DRV).
*
* Signal path:
*   Reference:  VDD_DRV -[Rref]-> nref -[XMREF diode-connected]-> GND_DRV
*   Divider:    VDD_DRV -[R1]-> ndiv -[R2]-> GND_DRV, with a positive-
*               feedback resistor Rfb from the buffered digital output
*               uvlo_ok back onto ndiv -- this is what creates the
*               hysteresis: Rfb effectively lowers the divider's top
*               resistance (R1||Rfb) while uvlo_ok is high (released),
*               raising ndiv for a given VDD_DRV and so requiring VDD_DRV
*               to fall further before ndiv drops back below nref (falling
*               threshold below rising threshold, matching decision record
*               0001 Decision 4's hysteresis direction). See
*               design/uvlo-comparator-sizing.md for the full derivation
*               and the measured tuning iterations.
*   Comparator: XMTAIL (current-mirrors off nref) biases a 5T differential
*               pair (XMINP/XMINN, thin... no, nfet_06v0, gates on
*               ndiv/nref) loaded by a pfet_06v0 current mirror
*               (XMLOADP/XMLOADN); ncompn is the single-ended output,
*               HIGH when ndiv > nref (VDD_DRV above the trip point).
*   Buffer:     ncompn -> INV1 (XMPINV1/XMNINV1) -> lockout (active-HIGH
*               pulldown-enable signal, HIGH during lockout) -> INV2
*               (XMPINV2/XMNINV2) -> uvlo_ok (active-HIGH "released"
*               status, drives Rfb).
*   Output:     XMPD, gate=lockout, drain=OUT, source=GND_DRV -- W=10u,
*               m=800 (effective 8000u), sized to dominate over
*               output_stage's own final push-pull stage (MP6, W=10u
*               m=500, design/output_stage.sch) so OUT is actively held
*               low regardless of what output_stage's own drive is doing.
*
* Generated by hand per xschem text format (same convention as
* design/level_shifter.sch / design/output_stage.sch), net connectivity
* verified via `xschem -x -n -s` (see PR description).
}
G {}
K {}
V {}
S {}
E {}

* --- reference generator: Rref + diode-connected XMREF ---
C {devices/res.sym} 0 -300 0 0 {name=Rref value=800k footprint=1206 device=resistor m=1}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} 0 -330 0 0 {name=l1 lab=VDD_DRV}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} 0 -270 0 0 {name=l2 lab=nref}
C {symbols/nfet_06v0.sym} 0 0 0 0 {name=MREF
L=0.7u
W=10u
nf=1
m=1
ad="'int((nf+1)/2) * W/nf * 0.18u'"
pd="'2*int((nf+1)/2) * (W/nf + 0.18u)'"
as="'int((nf+2)/2) * W/nf * 0.18u'"
ps="'2*int((nf+2)/2) * (W/nf + 0.18u)'"
nrd="'0.18u / W'" nrs="'0.18u / W'"
sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
model=nfet_06v0
spiceprefix=X
}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} 20 -30 0 0 {name=l3 lab=nref}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} -20 0 0 0 {name=l4 lab=nref}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} 20 30 0 0 {name=l5 lab=GND_DRV}
C {devices/lab_pin.sym} 20 0 0 0 {name=l6 lab=GND_DRV}

